+## DSP56300 FFI bridge status
+
+The optional `XBOXRECOMP_ENABLE_DSP56300` CMake setting builds the MIT-licensed
+`dsp56300-emu-ffi` static library from a separately checked-out upstream
+revision and creates GP/EP engine instances over the APU's existing backing
+arrays. The reviewed source revision is
+`82fb25a6917a36ac66212ae31f02aab62211f979`; set `DSP56300_SOURCE_DIR` to that
+clean checkout and make the Rust 1.99 toolchain available to CMake.
+
+This is only engine-lifecycle groundwork. The optional path does not yet route
+GP/EP MMIO, load/bootstrap firmware, schedule cycles, perform FIFO/DMA, or
+generate DSP audio. It remains off by default and is not playable-audio support.
+Do not enable it for a game run until those behaviors are implemented and
+verified. The existing passthrough remains the default.
+
 ## Files
 
 | File | LOC | Purpose |
 |------|-----|---------|
 | `apu.h` | 70 | **Public API** — init, shutdown, MMIO, mixer voices |
-| `apu_state.h` | 525 | APU state struct (VP, GP, EP, DSP core, 256 voices) |
+| `apu_state.h` | 537 | APU state struct (VP, GP, EP, DSP core, 256 voices) |
 | `apu_regs.h` | 366 | MCPX APU register definitions and field masks |
 | `apu_core.c` | 762 | MMIO handlers, frame thread, waveOut output, test tone |
 | `apu_vp.c` | 1,247 | Voice Processor — decode, resample, mix, envelopes, HRTF |
-| `apu_dsp.c` | 90 | GP/EP stubs (mixbin 0/1 passthrough) |
+| `apu_dsp.c` | 259 | GP/EP lifecycle and current passthrough stub |
+| `apu_dsp56300_bridge.c` | 96 | Optional FFI engine creation/reset/destruction and memory map |
+| `apu_dsp56300_bridge.h` | 13 | Optional bridge declarations |
 | `apu_mmio_hook.c` | 253 | VEH x86-64 instruction decoder for 0xFE800000+ MMIO |
 | `apu_shim.h` | 431 | QEMU compatibility (threads, atomics, clocks → Win32) |
 | `apu_debug.h` | 104 | Debug logging macros |
